    <p class="toc-entry toc-l1" style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; margin:0 0 6px 0; line-height:1.25; text-align:left; tab-stops:right dotted 16.8cm;">F. PH&#7908; L&#7908;C &amp; T&Agrave;I LI&#7878;U THAM KH&#7842;O<span style="mso-tab-count:1 dotted">	</span>17</p>
</div>
<h1>A. GI&#7898;I THI&#7878;U</h1>

<h3>1. M&#7909;c &#273;&iacute;ch t&agrave;i li&#7879;u</h3>
<p>T&agrave;i li&#7879;u n&agrave;y &#273;&#7863;c t&#7843; c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u ng&#432;&#7901;i d&ugrave;ng cu&#7889;i &#273;&#7889;i v&#7899;i t&iacute;nh n&#259;ng <b>Voucher Phase 2</b> tr&ecirc;n Website FPT.vn. Voucher Phase 2 m&#7903; r&#7897;ng ch&#7913;c n&#259;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng m&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute; cho <b>02 nh&oacute;m s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m</b>: d&#7883;ch v&#7909; <b>Internet/Combo</b> (t&#7841;i trang Checkout) v&agrave; thi&#7871;t b&#7883; <b>SKU/Camera</b> (t&#7841;i trang Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng). T&agrave;i li&#7879;u l&agrave;m c&#417; s&#7903; nghi&#7879;p v&#7909; &#273;&#7875; FE, BE, ECP, Product Hub v&agrave; QA/QC x&acirc;y d&#7921;ng gi&#7843;i ph&aacute;p &amp; k&#7883;ch b&#7843;n UAT.</p>
<p>M&#7895;i lu&#7891;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y g&#7891;m 4 ph&#7847;n: &#273;&#7863;c t&#7843; chi ti&#7871;t, quy t&#7855;c nghi&#7879;p v&#7909;, &#273;&#7863;c t&#7843; giao di&#7879;n &amp; r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c, edge cases &amp; b&#7843;ng m&atilde; l&#7895;i. C&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n t&#7855;c v&#7853;n h&agrave;nh chung t&#7841;i M&#7909;c B &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho m&#7885;i lu&#7891;ng.</p>

<h3>2. Th&ocirc;ng tin chung &amp; Hi&#7879;n tr&#7841;ng (AS-IS vs TO-BE)</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:5%; text-align:center;">STT</th><th style="width:20%;">H&#7841;ng m&#7909;c</th><th style="width:75%;">M&ocirc; t&#7843; chi ti&#7871;t</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">1</td><td><b>Gi&#7899;i thi&#7879;u t&#7893;ng quan</b></td><td>FPT.vn b&aacute;n &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i thi&#7871;t b&#7883; (SKU) v&agrave; d&#7883;ch v&#7909; Internet/Combo. Voucher Phase 2 th&ecirc;m c&#417; ch&#7871; popup ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i, validate &#273;a &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n (PTTT, &#273;&#417;n t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u, SL, khu v&#7921;c, lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;) v&agrave; th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o l&#7895;i chi ti&#7871;t. T&ecirc;n/m&ocirc; t&#7843;/h&igrave;nh &#7843;nh voucher do CMS (ECP) qu&#7843;n l&yacute;; FE render ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n t&#7915; API &mdash; kh&ocirc;ng hardcode.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">2</td><td><b>Hi&#7879;n tr&#7841;ng (AS-IS)</b></td><td>SKU/Camera: Phase 1 cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n, kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; popup danh s&aacute;ch, validate c&#417; b&#7843;n. Internet/Combo: ch&#432;a c&oacute; voucher. Chung: kh&ocirc;ng ki&#7875;m so&aacute;t c&#417; c&#7845;u lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;, th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o l&#7895;i generic.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">3</td><td><b>M&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u (TO-BE)</b></td><td>Popup &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&#7847;y &#273;&#7911; cho c&#7843; 2 nh&oacute;m: danh s&aacute;ch voucher KH (Active tr&#432;&#7899;c), label D-3 s&#7855;p h&#7871;t h&#7841;n, scroll khi &gt;452px. H&#7895; tr&#7907; nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay v&agrave; ch&#7885;n t&#7915; popup. BE validate to&agrave;n di&#7879;n. Th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o l&#7895;i c&#7909; th&#7875;. M&#7909;c ti&ecirc;u: t&#259;ng t&#7881; l&#7879; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng voucher v&agrave; t&#7881; l&#7879; chuy&#7875;n &#273;&#7893;i.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">4</td><td><b>Ph&#7841;m vi tri&#7875;n khai</b></td><td><b>K&#7929; thu&#7853;t:</b> Web &amp; Mobile responsive (FE), BE, t&iacute;ch h&#7907;p ECP. <b>Nghi&#7879;p v&#7909;:</b> 2 lu&#7891;ng &mdash; Internet/Combo t&#7841;i Checkout (vcp2net) v&agrave; SKU/Camera t&#7841;i Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng (vcp2sku). <b>Ngo&agrave;i ph&#7841;m vi:</b> ph&aacute;t h&agrave;nh/thu h&#7891;i voucher tr&ecirc;n CMS; voucher cho FPT Play, Smart Home, doanh nghi&#7879;p.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>3. Thu&#7853;t ng&#7919; v&agrave; vi&#7871;t t&#7855;t</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:5%; text-align:center;">STT</th><th style="width:14%;">Thu&#7853;t ng&#7919;</th><th style="width:25%;">T&ecirc;n &#273;&#7847;y &#273;&#7911;</th><th style="width:56%;">M&ocirc; t&#7843; &yacute; ngh&#297;a</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">1</td><td>URD</td><td>User Requirements Document</td><td>T&agrave;i li&#7879;u y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u ng&#432;&#7901;i d&ugrave;ng</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">2</td><td><b>Voucher</b></td><td>M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute; / Phi&#7871;u &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i</td><td>M&atilde; khuy&#7871;n m&atilde;i do FPT Telecom ph&aacute;t h&agrave;nh ho&#7863;c &#273;&#7889;i t&aacute;c cung c&#7845;p</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">3</td><td><b>ECP</b></td><td>E-Commerce Platform</td><td>H&#7879; th&#7889;ng qu&#7843;n l&yacute; voucher v&agrave; khuy&#7871;n m&atilde;i (Voucher Engine)</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">4</td><td><b>PTTT</b></td><td>Ph&#432;&#417;ng th&#7913;c thanh to&aacute;n</td><td>VietQR, V&iacute; MoMo/ZaloPay, Th&#7867; ATM/Visa/Master, COD</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">5</td><td><b>SKU</b></td><td>Stock Keeping Unit</td><td>S&#7843;n ph&#7849;m thi&#7871;t b&#7883; b&aacute;n l&#7867;: Camera IP, Access Point, TV...</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">6</td><td><b>SA</b></td><td>D&#7883;ch v&#7909; (Service)</td><td>D&#7883;ch v&#7909; Internet, Combo Internet+TV, Cloud Camera...</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">7</td><td><b>Popup &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i</b></td><td>Voucher Selection Modal</td><td>Modal overlay hi&#7875;n th&#7883; danh s&aacute;ch voucher c&#7911;a KH &#273;&#7875; ch&#7885;n</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">8</td><td><b>Active voucher</b></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Voucher c&ograve;n hi&#7879;u l&#7921;c, &#273;&#7911; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho &#273;&#417;n hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">9</td><td><b>Inactive voucher</b></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Voucher h&#7871;t h&#7841;n ho&#7863;c kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7911; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n (hi&#7875;n th&#7883; m&#7901;, disabled)</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">10</td><td><b>D-3</b></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Label c&#7843;nh b&aacute;o voucher s&#7855;p h&#7871;t h&#7841;n trong &le;3 ng&agrave;y t&#237;nh t&#7915; ng&agrave;y hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">11</td><td><b>Lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;</b></td><td>Mutual Exclusion</td><td>C&#417; ch&#7871; ng&#259;n hai voucher c&ugrave;ng Exclusion Group &aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">12</td><td><b>CMS</b></td><td>Content Management System</td><td>Qu&#7843;n l&yacute; n&#7897;i dung t&ecirc;n, m&ocirc; t&#7843;, h&igrave;nh &#7843;nh voucher tr&ecirc;n ECP</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">13</td><td><b>vcp2net</b></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Lu&#7891;ng voucher Phase 2 cho Internet/Combo (Checkout page)</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">14</td><td><b>vcp2sku</b></td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Lu&#7891;ng voucher Phase 2 cho SKU/Camera (Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng)</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">15</td><td>FE / BE</td><td>Frontend / Backend</td><td>Giao di&#7879;n website fpt.vn / H&#7879; th&#7889;ng x&#7917; l&yacute; logic ph&iacute;a m&aacute;y ch&#7911;</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<h1>B. T&#7892;NG QUAN H&#7878; TH&#7888;NG &amp; PH&#7840;M VI</h1>

<h3>1. S&#417; &#273;&#7891; lu&#7891;ng nghi&#7879;p v&#7909; t&#7893;ng quan (BPMN)</h3>
<div style="text-align:center; page-break-inside:avoid; margin:10px 0; overflow:hidden;">
<img class="diagram-img" width="605" height="520" style="width:16.0cm; height:auto; display:block; margin:0 auto; border:none; padding:0; mso-width-source:userset; mso-height-source:userset;" src="data:image/png;base64,">
</div>
<div class="note-box">
    <strong>C&aacute;ch &#273;&#7885;c s&#417; &#273;&#7891; (BPMN):</strong> 3 l&agrave;n tr&aacute;ch nhi&#7879;m: <strong>Kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng</strong> &ndash; ch&#7885;n/nh&#7853;p voucher; <strong>Website/Frontend</strong> &ndash; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; popup, c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n; <strong>Backend &amp; ECP</strong> &ndash; l&#7845;y danh s&aacute;ch, validate, t&iacute;nh gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;. K&yacute; hi&#7879;u: v&ograve;ng tr&ograve;n m&#7843;nh = Start; v&ograve;ng tr&ograve;n &#273;&#7853;m = End; ch&#7919; nh&#7853;t bo g&oacute;c = Task; h&igrave;nh thoi &times; = Exclusive Gateway.
</div>
<p><b>Nguy&ecirc;n t&#7855;c v&#7853;n h&agrave;nh xuy&ecirc;n su&#7889;t:</b></p>
<ul>
    <li>BE/ECP x&#7917; l&yacute; to&agrave;n b&#7897; validate &amp; t&iacute;nh gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;; FE ch&#7881; nh&#7853;n k&#7871;t qu&#7843; &amp; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; real-time.</li>
    <li>T&ecirc;n, m&ocirc; t&#7843;, h&igrave;nh &#7843;nh voucher do CMS (ECP) qu&#7843;n l&yacute;; FE render theo API, kh&ocirc;ng hardcode.</li>
    <li>M&#7885;i thay &#273;&#7893;i &#273;&#417;n (&#273;&#7893;i PTTT, th&ecirc;m/b&#7899;t SP) trigger re-validate voucher &#273;ang &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</li>
    <li>Validate l&#7847;n cu&#7889;i (server-side final check) b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c khi submit &#273;&#417;n.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2. Ph&acirc;n lo&#7841;i 02 lu&#7891;ng &amp; &#273;i&#7875;m &aacute;p d&#7909;ng voucher</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:24%;">Lu&#7891;ng</th><th style="width:22%;">Nh&oacute;m s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m</th><th style="width:22%;">&#272;i&#7875;m &aacute;p d&#7909;ng</th><th style="width:32%;">M&ocirc; t&#7843;</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>vcp2net</b> &mdash; Internet/Combo</td><td>Internet, Combo Internet+TV, Combo Internet+Camera</td><td>Trang Checkout (sau b&#432;&#7899;c nh&#7853;p th&ocirc;ng tin KH)</td><td>Section &#8220;M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;&#8221; + n&uacute;t &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221; t&#7841;i Checkout page.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>vcp2sku</b> &mdash; SKU/Camera</td><td>Camera IP, thi&#7871;t b&#7883; &#273;&#7847;u cu&#7889;i, Cloud Camera (SA &#273;i k&egrave;m)</td><td>Trang Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng (Cart)</td><td>Section &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221; b&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i danh s&aacute;ch SP; re-validate khi gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

