<h3>4. &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; giao di&#7879;n Popup &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i d&ugrave;ng chung</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:22%;">Th&agrave;nh ph&#7847;n</th><th style="width:14%; text-align:center;">M&agrave;n h&igrave;nh</th><th style="width:10%; text-align:center;">B&#7855;t bu&#7897;c</th><th style="width:54%;">Y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u hi&#7875;n th&#7883; &amp; h&agrave;nh vi</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>Popup container</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Modal overlay. Max-height: <b>452px</b>; khi n&#7897;i dung v&#432;&#7907;t qu&aacute; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; scroll bar d&#7885;c trong v&ugrave;ng danh s&aacute;ch. Header popup c&#7889; &#273;&#7883;nh.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Section &#8220;M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;&#8221;</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>&Ocirc; input nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay + n&uacute;t &#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221;. Khi &#273;ang validate: disable input &amp; n&uacute;t + spinner. Khi l&#7895;i: highlight &#273;&#7887; + th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o inline.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Section &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Danh s&aacute;ch card voucher. Th&#7913; t&#7921;: (1) Active &mdash; h&#7841;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng t&#259;ng d&#7847;n; (2) Inactive &mdash; cu&#7889;i danh s&aacute;ch, hi&#7875;n th&#7883; m&#7901;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Voucher card</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">&ndash;</td><td>Hi&#7875;n th&#7883;: h&igrave;nh &#7843;nh (CMS), t&ecirc;n, m&ocirc; t&#7843;, h&#7841;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng, &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n. Active: border xanh. Inactive: opacity th&#7845;p, n&#7873;n x&aacute;m, n&uacute;t disabled.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Label D-3</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">&ndash;</td><td>Badge cam &#8220;C&ograve;n X ng&agrave;y&#8221; khi ng&agrave;y h&#7871;t h&#7841;n &le;3 ng&agrave;y. X = s&#7889; ng&agrave;y c&ograve;n l&#7841;i (t&iacute;nh c&#7843; ng&agrave;y hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i r&#7895;ng</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>ECP tr&#7843; danh s&aacute;ch r&#7895;ng: <span class="error-inline">&#8220;R&#7845;t ti&#7871;c, qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i n&agrave;o.&#8221;</span> V&#7851;n hi&#7875;n th&#7883; &ocirc; nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>N&uacute;t &#8220;S&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b></td><td style="text-align:center;">C&#7843; hai</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Enabled ch&#7881; khi ch&#7885;n Active voucher. Click: popup &#273;&oacute;ng, voucher &aacute;p d&#7909;ng, t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<div class="note-box"><strong>Nguy&ecirc;n t&#7855;c chung l&#7895;i voucher:</strong>
    <ul>
        <li>L&#7895;i l&agrave;m sai t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n ph&#7843;i ch&#7863;n thanh to&aacute;n cho &#273;&#7871;n khi d&#7919; li&#7879;u h&#7907;p l&#7879;.</li>
        <li>Message l&#7895;i d&ugrave;ng copy nghi&#7879;p v&#7909; r&otilde; r&agrave;ng; m&atilde; l&#7895;i k&#7929; thu&#7853;t ch&#7881; cho log/CSKH.</li>
        <li>Re-validate l&#7847;n cu&#7889;i t&#7841;i BE khi submit &#273;&#417;n, b&#7845;t k&#7875; k&#7871;t qu&#7843; validate ph&iacute;a FE.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
<h1>C. &#272;&#7862;C T&#7842; CHI TI&#7870;T C&Aacute;C LU&#7892;NG VOUCHER</h1>
<p>M&#7895;i lu&#7891;ng g&#7891;m <b>4 ph&#7847;n</b>: <b>.1</b> &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; chi ti&#7871;t; <b>.2</b> Quy t&#7855;c nghi&#7879;p v&#7909;; <b>.3</b> &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; giao di&#7879;n &amp; r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c; <b>.4</b> Edge cases &amp; B&#7843;ng m&atilde; l&#7895;i. Nguy&ecirc;n t&#7855;c chung t&#7841;i M&#7909;c B &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho m&#7885;i lu&#7891;ng.</p>

<h2>1. Lu&#7891;ng Voucher &mdash; Internet/Combo (Trang Checkout)</h2>
<p><span class="flow-band">Lu&#7891;ng: vcp2net &middot; Internet / Combo &middot; &#272;i&#7875;m &aacute;p d&#7909;ng: Checkout</span> &nbsp; KH &#273;&#7871;n trang Checkout d&#7883;ch v&#7909; Internet/Combo; h&#7879; th&#7889;ng hi&#7875;n th&#7883; section <b>&#8220;M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;&#8221;</b> v&agrave; n&uacute;t <b>&#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b>.</p>

<h3>1.1 &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; chi ti&#7871;t (Quy tr&igrave;nh t&#7915;ng b&#432;&#7899;c)</h3>
<table class="usecase-table">
    <tr><td class="label">T&aacute;c nh&acirc;n</td><td>Kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng &#273;&#259;ng k&yacute; Internet/Combo tr&ecirc;n FPT.vn</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">&#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n b&#7855;t &#273;&#7847;u</td><td>KH &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#7871;n trang Checkout; section &#8220;M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;&#8221; hi&#7875;n th&#7883;.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">Lu&#7891;ng x&#7917; l&yacute; ch&iacute;nh</td><td>
        <b>B1:</b> KH b&#7845;m <b>&#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b> ho&#7863;c nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay v&agrave;o &ocirc; &#8220;M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;&#8221;.<br>
        <b>B2:</b> N&#7871;u m&#7903; popup: FE g&#7885;i ECP l&#7845;y danh s&aacute;ch voucher KH &rarr; popup hi&#7875;n th&#7883; (Active l&ecirc;n &#273;&#7847;u, label D-3, scroll khi &gt;452px).<br>
        <b>B3:</b> KH nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay + b&#7845;m &#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221; <b>ho&#7863;c</b> ch&#7885;n voucher trong popup + b&#7845;m &#8220;S&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;.<br>
        <b>B4:</b> FE g&#7917;i request validate l&ecirc;n BE/ECP; BE ki&#7875;m tra PTTT, &#273;&#417;n t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u, khu v&#7921;c, lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;...<br>
        <b>B5:</b> H&#7907;p l&#7879; &rarr; ECP tr&#7843; s&#7889; ti&#7873;n gi&#7843;m; FE c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t t&#7893;ng, popup &#273;&oacute;ng, section hi&#7875;n th&#7883; &#8220;1 &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;ang &aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221;.<br>
        <b>B6:</b> KH x&aacute;c nh&#7853;n &amp; thanh to&aacute;n &rarr; BE final check &rarr; t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n SPF &rarr; Ho&agrave;n t&#7845;t.
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">&#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n k&#7871;t th&uacute;c</td><td>Voucher &aacute;p d&#7909;ng th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng; t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t; &#273;&#417;n Internet/Combo t&#7841;o th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">Lu&#7891;ng thay th&#7871; / Ngo&#7841;i l&#7879;</td><td>
        <b>Alt 1 &mdash; Validate th&#7845;t b&#7841;i:</b> BE tr&#7843; m&atilde; l&#7895;i &rarr; FE disable voucher + th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o chi ti&#7871;t &rarr; KH ch&#7885;n voucher kh&aacute;c.<br>
        <b>Alt 2 &mdash; Danh s&aacute;ch r&#7895;ng:</b> ECP tr&#7843; r&#7895;ng &rarr; popup hi&#7875;n th&#7883; th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o; v&#7851;n cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay.<br>
        <b>Alt 3 &mdash; &#272;&#7893;i PTTT sau khi &aacute;p:</b> Re-validate; PTTT m&#7899;i kh&ocirc;ng h&#7907;p l&#7879; &rarr; t&#7921; g&#7905; voucher + toast.<br>
        <b>Alt 4 &mdash; ECP timeout:</b> Sau 10s &rarr; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; l&#7895;i timeout; v&#7851;n cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay.
    </td></tr>
</table>

<h3>1.2 Quy t&#7855;c nghi&#7879;p v&#7909;</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:14%; text-align:center;">M&atilde;</th><th style="width:24%;">T&ecirc;n quy t&#7855;c</th><th style="width:62%;">N&#7897;i dung &amp; Logic h&#7879; th&#7889;ng</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-01</td><td>&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng 1 voucher / &#273;&#417;n</td><td>M&#7895;i &#273;&#417;n Internet/Combo ch&#7881; &aacute;p d&#7909;ng t&#7889;i &#273;a 1 voucher t&#7841;i m&#7897;t th&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m (tr&#7915; khi ECP c&#7845;u h&igrave;nh stackable).</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-02</td><td>Validate PTTT</td><td>Voucher c&oacute; th&#7875; gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n theo PTTT c&#7909; th&#7875;. BE/ECP ki&#7875;m tra PTTT hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i. Khi KH &#273;&#7893;i PTTT sau &aacute;p voucher &rarr; re-validate t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-03</td><td>Validate &#273;&#417;n t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u</td><td>min_order t&iacute;nh tr&ecirc;n gi&aacute; g&#7889;c tr&#432;&#7899;c gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;. Kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7841;t &rarr; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i + th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o r&otilde; y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-04</td><td>C&#417; c&#7845;u lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;</td><td>Exclusion Group c&#7845;u h&igrave;nh t&#7841;i ECP. Voucher c&ugrave;ng nh&oacute;m kh&ocirc;ng d&ugrave;ng &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i. FE disable trong popup + hi&#7875;n th&#7883; t&ecirc;n voucher conflict.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-05</td><td>Th&#7913; t&#7921; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; popup</td><td>Active (&#273;&#7911; &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n) &rarr; h&#7841;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng t&#259;ng d&#7847;n. Inactive &rarr; cu&#7889;i, hi&#7875;n th&#7883; m&#7901;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-06</td><td>Label D-3</td><td>Badge &#8220;C&ograve;n X ng&agrave;y&#8221; khi h&#7841;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &le;3 ng&agrave;y t&iacute;nh t&#7915; ng&agrave;y hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-07</td><td>N&#7897;i dung voucher t&#7915; CMS</td><td>T&ecirc;n, m&ocirc; t&#7843;, h&igrave;nh &#7843;nh l&#7845;y t&#7915; CMS (ECP); FE render theo response, kh&ocirc;ng hardcode.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">NET-BR-08</td><td>Final check khi submit</td><td>BE/ECP validate l&#7841;i t&#7841;i th&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n. Voucher kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n h&#7907;p l&#7879; &rarr; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n + tr&#7843; l&#7895;i chi ti&#7871;t.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>1.3 &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; giao di&#7879;n &amp; r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c tr&#432;&#7901;ng</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:22%;">Ph&#7847;n t&#7917;</th><th style="width:14%;">M&agrave;n h&igrave;nh</th><th style="width:8%; text-align:center;">B&#7855;t bu&#7897;c</th><th style="width:56%;">R&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c &amp; h&agrave;nh vi</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>Section &#8220;M&atilde; gi&#7843;m gi&aacute;&#8221;</b></td><td>Checkout</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>&Ocirc; input + n&uacute;t &#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221; + link &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;. Sau khi &aacute;p: hi&#7875;n th&#7883; m&atilde;, s&#7889; ti&#7873;n gi&#7843;m, n&uacute;t &#8220;G&#7905; b&#7887;&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>N&uacute;t &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b></td><td>Checkout</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>M&#7903; popup. Sau &aacute;p: thay b&#7857;ng &#8220;1 &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221; + icon check. Ch&#432;a login &rarr; redirect &#273;&#259;ng nh&#7853;p.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Input nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay</b></td><td>Checkout / Popup</td><td style="text-align:center;">&ndash;</td><td>Max 50 k&yacute; t&#7921;; trim whitespace tr&#432;&#7899;c validate. L&#7895;i: highlight &#273;&#7887; + inline message.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>N&uacute;t &#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221;</b></td><td>Checkout / Popup</td><td style="text-align:center;">&ndash;</td><td>Disabled khi input r&#7895;ng. Spinner khi &#273;ang g&#7885;i API. Enabled l&#7841;i sau nh&#7853;n k&#7871;t qu&#7843;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>N&uacute;t &#8220;G&#7905; b&#7887;&#8221;</b></td><td>Checkout</td><td style="text-align:center;">&ndash;</td><td>Hi&#7875;n th&#7883; khi &#273;&atilde; &aacute;p voucher. Click: g&#7905; voucher, t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n v&#7873; gi&aacute; g&#7889;c.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>T&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n thanh to&aacute;n</b></td><td>Checkout</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Real-time khi &aacute;p/g&#7905;. Hi&#7875;n th&#7883; r&otilde;: gi&aacute; g&#7889;c, s&#7889; ti&#7873;n gi&#7843;m, t&#7893;ng c&#7847;n thanh to&aacute;n.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>1.4 Edge cases &amp; B&#7843;ng m&atilde; l&#7895;i</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:16%;">M&atilde; l&#7895;i</th><th style="width:24%;">Tr&#432;&#7901;ng h&#7907;p</th><th style="width:37%;">Message hi&#7875;n th&#7883;</th><th style="width:23%;">H&agrave;nh vi h&#7879; th&#7889;ng</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V01</td><td>M&atilde; kh&ocirc;ng t&#7891;n t&#7841;i / h&#7871;t h&#7841;n</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng t&#7891;n t&#7841;i ho&#7863;c &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n.&#8221;</td><td>Inline error d&#432;&#7899;i input; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V02</td><td>Kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7841;t &#273;&#417;n t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#272;&#417;n h&agrave;ng ch&#432;a &#273;&#7841;t gi&aacute; tr&#7883; t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u &#273;&#7875; &aacute;p d&#7909;ng m&atilde; n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V03</td><td>PTTT kh&ocirc;ng h&#7907;p l&#7879;</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho ph&#432;&#417;ng th&#7913;c thanh to&aacute;n n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V04</td><td>Lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; v&#7899;i voucher &#273;ang d&ugrave;ng</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i v&#7899;i &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;ang s&#7917; d&#7909;ng.&#8221;</td><td>Disable card; inline tr&ecirc;n card.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V05</td><td>M&atilde; &#273;&atilde; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng (limit/KH)</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng.&#8221;</td><td>Inline error d&#432;&#7899;i input.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V06</td><td>Ch&#7881; cho KH m&#7899;i</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i ch&#7881; d&agrave;nh cho kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng &#273;&#7863;t h&agrave;ng l&#7847;n &#273;&#7847;u.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V07</td><td>Voucher expire khi submit</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n. Vui l&ograve;ng ch&#7885;n m&atilde; kh&aacute;c ho&#7863;c ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i.&#8221;</td><td>G&#7905; voucher; cho KH ch&#7885;n l&#7841;i.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V08</td><td>ECP timeout</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng th&#7875; t&#7843;i danh s&aacute;ch &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i, vui l&ograve;ng th&#7917; l&#7841;i.&#8221;</td><td>Banner trong popup; v&#7851;n cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_NET_V09</td><td>&#272;&#7893;i PTTT sau khi &aacute;p voucher</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; b&#7883; g&#7905; v&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho ph&#432;&#417;ng th&#7913;c thanh to&aacute;n m&#7899;i.&#8221;</td><td>T&#7921; g&#7905;; toast.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>MSG_NET_V_OK</td><td>&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng</td><td class="success-inline">&#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng! B&#7841;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c gi&#7843;m [X]&#273; cho &#273;&#417;n h&agrave;ng n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>&#272;&oacute;ng popup; c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<h2>2. Lu&#7891;ng Voucher &mdash; SKU/Camera (Trang Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng)</h2>
<p><span class="flow-band">Lu&#7891;ng: vcp2sku &middot; SKU / Camera &middot; &#272;i&#7875;m &aacute;p d&#7909;ng: Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng</span> &nbsp; Section <b>&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b> t&#7841;i Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng; validate &#273;&#7863;c th&ugrave; SKU: SL SP, khu v&#7921;c, lo&#7841;i SKU; re-validate t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng khi gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i.</p>

<h3>2.1 &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; chi ti&#7871;t (Quy tr&igrave;nh t&#7915;ng b&#432;&#7899;c)</h3>
<table class="usecase-table">
    <tr><td class="label">T&aacute;c nh&acirc;n</td><td>Kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng mua Camera / SKU tr&ecirc;n FPT.vn</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">&#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n b&#7855;t &#273;&#7847;u</td><td>KH c&oacute; s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m SKU/Camera trong gi&#7887;; section &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221; hi&#7875;n th&#7883;.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">Lu&#7891;ng x&#7917; l&yacute; ch&iacute;nh</td><td>
        <b>B1:</b> KH b&#7845;m <b>&#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b> ho&#7863;c nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay trong section &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;.<br>
        <b>B2:</b> Popup m&#7903;: FE g&#7885;i ECP l&#7845;y danh s&aacute;ch voucher KH (l&#7885;c theo lo&#7841;i SKU, SL, &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881; n&#7871;u &#273;&atilde; c&oacute;).<br>
        <b>B3:</b> KH nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay + b&#7845;m &#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221; <b>ho&#7863;c</b> ch&#7885;n t&#7915; popup + b&#7845;m &#8220;S&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;.<br>
        <b>B4:</b> BE/ECP validate: PTTT (n&#7871;u &#273;&atilde; ch&#7885;n), SL t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u, khu v&#7921;c, lo&#7841;i SKU, lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;...<br>
        <b>B5:</b> H&#7907;p l&#7879; &rarr; FE c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n gi&#7887;; popup &#273;&oacute;ng; section hi&#7875;n th&#7883; &#8220;1 &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;ang &aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221;.<br>
        <b>B6:</b> KH &#273;i&#7873;u ch&#7881;nh gi&#7887; (th&ecirc;m/b&#7899;t SP, &#273;&#7893;i SL) &rarr; h&#7879; th&#7889;ng re-validate voucher &#273;ang &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.<br>
        <b>B7:</b> KH &#8220;Ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c thanh to&aacute;n&#8221; &rarr; Checkout &rarr; BE final check &rarr; Ho&agrave;n t&#7845;t.
    </td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">&#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n k&#7871;t th&uacute;c</td><td>Voucher &aacute;p d&#7909;ng th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng; t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n gi&#7887; c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t; &#273;&#417;n SKU t&#7841;o th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng sau thanh to&aacute;n.</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="label">Lu&#7891;ng thay th&#7871; / Ngo&#7841;i l&#7879;</td><td>
        <b>Alt 1 &mdash; Gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i l&agrave;m voucher m&#7845;t hi&#7879;u l&#7921;c:</b> Re-validate th&#7845;t b&#7841;i &rarr; t&#7921; g&#7905; voucher + toast.<br>
        <b>Alt 2 &mdash; Khu v&#7921;c kh&ocirc;ng match:</b> Disable trong popup + th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o l&#7895;i khu v&#7921;c.<br>
        <b>Alt 3 &mdash; SL kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7911;:</b> Th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o c&#7847;n th&ecirc;m SP c&#7909; th&#7875;.<br>
        <b>Alt 4 &mdash; Lo&#7841;i SKU kh&ocirc;ng match:</b> Th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho SP trong gi&#7887;.
    </td></tr>
</table>

<h4>2.1.1 K&#7883;ch b&#7843;n &#273;&#7863;c th&ugrave; vcp2sku</h4>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:20%;">K&#7883;ch b&#7843;n</th><th style="width:42%;">M&ocirc; t&#7843;</th><th style="width:38%;">H&agrave;nh vi b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>Case 1 &mdash; Gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i</b></td><td>KH &#273;&atilde; &aacute;p voucher; sau &#273;&oacute; x&oacute;a SP l&agrave;m t&#7893;ng kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7841;t min_quantity.</td><td>Re-validate t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng; t&#7921; g&#7905; voucher; toast &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; b&#7883; g&#7905; do gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng thay &#273;&#7893;i&#8221;; t&#7893;ng v&#7873; gi&aacute; g&#7889;c.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Case 2 &mdash; Khu v&#7921;c</b></td><td>Voucher ch&#7881; &aacute;p d&#7909;ng HCM/HN; KH giao &#273;&#7871;n t&#7881;nh kh&aacute;c.</td><td>Disable trong popup; nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay &rarr; th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho khu v&#7921;c c&#7911;a qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Case 3 &mdash; Lo&#7841;i SKU</b></td><td>Voucher ch&#7881; &aacute;p Camera IP, kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p router/TV.</td><td>ECP l&#7885;c tr&#432;&#7899;c khi tr&#7843;; nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay &rarr; th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m trong gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Case 4 &mdash; Lo&#7841;i tr&#7915;</b></td><td>KH mu&#7889;n ch&#7885;n voucher B trong khi &#273;ang d&ugrave;ng voucher A (c&ugrave;ng Exclusion Group).</td><td>Voucher B disabled trong popup v&#7899;i label conflict. KH ph&#7843;i g&#7905; A tr&#432;&#7899;c khi ch&#7885;n B.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2.2 Quy t&#7855;c nghi&#7879;p v&#7909;</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:14%; text-align:center;">M&atilde;</th><th style="width:24%;">T&ecirc;n quy t&#7855;c</th><th style="width:62%;">N&#7897;i dung &amp; Logic h&#7879; th&#7889;ng</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-01</td><td>Validate SL SP t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u</td><td>Voucher c&oacute; th&#7875; y&ecirc;u c&#7847;u t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u N &#273;&#417;n v&#7883; SKU ho&#7863;c t&#7893;ng SL gi&#7887;. Kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7841;t &rarr; &#8220;C&#7847;n th&ecirc;m X s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m &#273;&#7875; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i n&agrave;y&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-02</td><td>Validate khu v&#7921;c &#273;&#7883;a l&yacute;</td><td>Voucher gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n theo t&#7881;nh/th&agrave;nh. BE ki&#7875;m tra &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881; giao h&agrave;ng. Ch&#432;a c&oacute; &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881; khi xem popup &rarr; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; danh s&aacute;ch chung; validate ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c khi c&oacute; &#273;&#7883;a ch&#7881;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-03</td><td>Validate lo&#7841;i SKU</td><td>Voucher gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n theo danh m&#7909;c SKU (Camera IP, AP...). ECP l&#7885;c theo lo&#7841;i SKU trong gi&#7887; khi tr&#7843; danh s&aacute;ch v&agrave; khi validate m&atilde; tay.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-04</td><td>Re-validate khi gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i</td><td>B&#7845;t k&#7923; thay &#273;&#7893;i gi&#7887; (th&ecirc;m/b&#7899;t d&ograve;ng, &#273;&#7893;i SL, &#273;&#7893;i chu k&#7923; Cloud, x&oacute;a SP) trigger re-validate voucher &#273;ang &aacute;p. Kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n h&#7907;p l&#7879; &rarr; t&#7921; g&#7905; + toast.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-05</td><td>Lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; &amp; Exclusion Group</td><td>T&#432;&#417;ng t&#7921; NET-BR-04. Voucher c&ugrave;ng Exclusion Group kh&ocirc;ng d&ugrave;ng &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i. Disable v&#7899;i th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o conflict.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-06</td><td>Th&#7913; t&#7921; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; &amp; label D-3</td><td>T&#432;&#417;ng t&#7921; NET-BR-05, NET-BR-06.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-07</td><td>&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng 1 voucher / gi&#7887;</td><td>T&#7889;i &#273;a 1 voucher / gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng t&#7841;i m&#7897;t th&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m.</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="text-align:center;">SKU-BR-08</td><td>Final check khi submit</td><td>BE/ECP validate l&#7841;i khi t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n SPF. Voucher kh&ocirc;ng h&#7907;p l&#7879; &rarr; t&#7915; ch&#7889;i + l&#7895;i chi ti&#7871;t.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2.3 &#272;&#7863;c t&#7843; giao di&#7879;n &amp; r&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c tr&#432;&#7901;ng</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:22%;">Ph&#7847;n t&#7917;</th><th style="width:14%;">M&agrave;n h&igrave;nh</th><th style="width:8%; text-align:center;">B&#7855;t bu&#7897;c</th><th style="width:56%;">R&agrave;ng bu&#7897;c &amp; h&agrave;nh vi</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>Section &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b></td><td>Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>B&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i danh s&aacute;ch SP: &ocirc; nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay + n&uacute;t &#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng&#8221; + n&uacute;t &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;. Sau &aacute;p: hi&#7875;n th&#7883; m&atilde;, s&#7889; ti&#7873;n gi&#7843;m, n&uacute;t &#8220;G&#7905; b&#7887;&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>T&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng</b></td><td>Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Real-time khi &aacute;p/g&#7905; voucher, th&ecirc;m/b&#7899;t SP, &#273;&#7893;i SL. Hi&#7875;n th&#7883;: gi&aacute; g&#7889;c, ti&#7873;n gi&#7843;m, t&#7893;ng thanh to&aacute;n.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i re-validate</b></td><td>Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Khi voucher t&#7921; g&#7905;: t&#7893;ng v&#7873; gi&aacute; g&#7889;c + toast &#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; b&#7883; g&#7905; do gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng thay &#273;&#7893;i&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>N&uacute;t &#8220;S&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;</b></td><td>Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng (Popup)</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Enabled ch&#7881; khi ch&#7885;n Active voucher. Disabled cho Inactive. Click &rarr; &aacute;p d&#7909;ng + &#273;&oacute;ng popup + c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t t&#7893;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>N&uacute;t &#8220;Ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c thanh to&aacute;n&#8221;</b></td><td>Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng</td><td style="text-align:center;">C&oacute;</td><td>Enabled khi &ge;1 d&ograve;ng SP &#273;&#432;&#7907;c tick. Disabled khi gi&#7887; r&#7895;ng. Voucher h&#7907;p l&#7879; v&#7899;i t&#7893;ng = 0&#273; v&#7851;n cho ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2.4 Edge cases &amp; B&#7843;ng m&atilde; l&#7895;i</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:16%;">M&atilde; l&#7895;i</th><th style="width:24%;">Tr&#432;&#7901;ng h&#7907;p</th><th style="width:37%;">Message hi&#7875;n th&#7883;</th><th style="width:23%;">H&agrave;nh vi h&#7879; th&#7889;ng</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V01</td><td>M&atilde; kh&ocirc;ng t&#7891;n t&#7841;i / h&#7871;t h&#7841;n</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng t&#7891;n t&#7841;i ho&#7863;c &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n.&#8221;</td><td>Inline error; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V02</td><td>SL SP kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7911;</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;C&#7847;n th&ecirc;m X s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m &#273;&#7875; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; disable n&uacute;t &#8220;S&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221;.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V03</td><td>Khu v&#7921;c kh&ocirc;ng h&#7907;p l&#7879;</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho khu v&#7921;c c&#7911;a qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; disable card trong popup.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V04</td><td>Lo&#7841;i SKU kh&ocirc;ng match</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m trong gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng c&#7911;a b&#7841;n.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V05</td><td>Lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; v&#7899;i voucher &#273;ang d&ugrave;ng</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i v&#7899;i &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;ang s&#7917; d&#7909;ng.&#8221;</td><td>Disable card; inline tr&ecirc;n card.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V06</td><td>Gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i g&#7905; voucher t&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; b&#7883; g&#7905; do gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng thay &#273;&#7893;i.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; g&#7905; voucher; t&#7893;ng v&#7873; gi&aacute; g&#7889;c.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V07</td><td>Kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7841;t &#273;&#417;n t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#272;&#417;n h&agrave;ng ch&#432;a &#273;&#7841;t gi&aacute; tr&#7883; t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u &#273;&#7875; &aacute;p d&#7909;ng m&atilde; n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V08</td><td>Voucher expire khi submit</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n. Vui l&ograve;ng ch&#7885;n m&atilde; kh&aacute;c ho&#7863;c ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i.&#8221;</td><td>G&#7905; voucher; cho KH ch&#7885;n l&#7841;i.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ERR_SKU_V09</td><td>ECP timeout</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng th&#7875; t&#7843;i danh s&aacute;ch &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i, vui l&ograve;ng th&#7917; l&#7841;i.&#8221;</td><td>Banner trong popup; v&#7851;n cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>MSG_SKU_V_OK</td><td>&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng</td><td class="success-inline">&#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng! B&#7841;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c gi&#7843;m [X]&#273; cho &#273;&#417;n h&agrave;ng n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>&#272;&oacute;ng popup; c&#7853;p nh&#7853;t t&#7893;ng ti&#7873;n gi&#7887;.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<h1>D. TR&#431;&#7902;NG H&#7906;P L&#7896;I &amp; TH&Ocirc;NG B&Aacute;O H&#7878; TH&#7888;NG</h1>

<h3>1. Nguy&ecirc;n t&#7855;c hi&#7875;n th&#7883; l&#7895;i &amp; retry</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>&#431;u ti&ecirc;n th&ocirc;ng &#273;i&#7879;p nghi&#7879;p v&#7909;:</b> KH ch&#7881; th&#7845;y message d&#7877; hi&#7875;u; m&atilde; l&#7895;i k&#7929; thu&#7853;t ch&#7881; cho log/CSKH.</li>
    <li><b>Kh&ocirc;ng cho thanh to&aacute;n khi d&#7919; li&#7879;u ch&#432;a h&#7907;p l&#7879;:</b> L&#7895;i t&iacute;nh gi&aacute;/PTTT/voucher sai &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n t&#7841;i submit ph&#7843;i ch&#7863;n &#273;&#7863;t h&agrave;ng.</li>
    <li><b>B&#7843;o to&agrave;n d&#7919; li&#7879;u KH:</b> Retry l&#7895;i API gi&#7919; nguy&ecirc;n m&atilde; voucher, gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng, th&ocirc;ng tin KH &#273;&atilde; &#273;i&#7873;n.</li>
    <li><b>Retry &#273;&uacute;ng ngu&#7891;n l&#7895;i:</b> CTA &#8220;Th&#7917; l&#7841;i&#8221;/&#8220;&Aacute;p d&#7909;ng l&#7841;i&#8221; g&#7885;i l&#7841;i &#273;&uacute;ng API + ghi log th&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m, m&atilde; l&#7895;i.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2. C&aacute;c tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i l&#7895;i voucher d&ugrave;ng chung</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:18%;">Tr&#7841;ng th&aacute;i</th><th style="width:22%;">&#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n k&iacute;ch ho&#7841;t</th><th style="width:34%;">Message hi&#7875;n th&#7883;</th><th style="width:26%;">H&agrave;nh vi / CTA</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td><b>ECP timeout</b></td><td>Kh&ocirc;ng ph&#7843;n h&#7891;i trong 10 gi&acirc;y.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng th&#7875; t&#7843;i danh s&aacute;ch &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i, vui l&ograve;ng th&#7917; l&#7841;i.&#8221;</td><td>Banner trong popup; CTA <b>Th&#7917; l&#7841;i</b>; v&#7851;n cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Validate th&#7845;t b&#7841;i</b></td><td>BE/ECP tr&#7843; m&atilde; l&#7895;i validate.</td><td class="error-inline">Theo m&atilde; l&#7895;i c&#7909; th&#7875; (xem C.1.4 / C.2.4)</td><td>Toast ho&#7863;c inline; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng; KH th&#7917; m&atilde; kh&aacute;c.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>T&#7921; &#273;&#7897;ng g&#7905; voucher</b></td><td>Re-validate th&#7845;t b&#7841;i sau &#273;&#7893;i PTTT ho&#7863;c gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; b&#7883; g&#7905; do [l&yacute; do].&#8221;</td><td>Toast t&#7921; &#273;&oacute;ng sau 4 gi&acirc;y; t&#7893;ng v&#7873; gi&aacute; g&#7889;c.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Expire khi submit</b></td><td>Race condition: voucher h&#7871;t h&#7841;n &#273;&uacute;ng l&uacute;c t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n. Vui l&ograve;ng ch&#7885;n m&atilde; kh&aacute;c ho&#7863;c ti&#7871;p t&#7909;c kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i.&#8221;</td><td>Ch&#7863;n t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n; cho KH ch&#7885;n l&#7841;i / b&#7887; qua.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Danh s&aacute;ch r&#7895;ng</b></td><td>ECP tr&#7843; danh s&aacute;ch r&#7895;ng.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;R&#7845;t ti&#7871;c, qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i n&agrave;o.&#8221;</td><td>Hi&#7875;n th&#7883; trong popup; v&#7851;n cho nh&#7853;p m&atilde; tay t&#7915; k&ecirc;nh kh&aacute;c.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Ch&#432;a &#273;&#259;ng nh&#7853;p</b></td><td>B&#7845;m &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221; khi ch&#432;a login.</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Redirect &#273;&#259;ng nh&#7853;p; sau login redirect v&#7873; trang hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h3>3. B&#7843;ng m&atilde; l&#7895;i d&ugrave;ng chung (Voucher Phase 2)</h3>
<table class="data-table">
    <thead><tr><th style="width:18%;">M&atilde; l&#7895;i</th><th style="width:14%;">M&agrave;n h&igrave;nh</th><th style="width:22%;">&#272;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n</th><th style="width:30%;">Message th&ocirc;ng b&aacute;o</th><th style="width:16%;">H&agrave;nh &#273;&#7897;ng</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr><td>VCP_INVALID</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>M&atilde; kh&ocirc;ng t&#7891;n t&#7841;i trong ECP.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng t&#7891;n t&#7841;i ho&#7863;c &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n.&#8221;</td><td>Kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_MIN_ORDER</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>T&#7893;ng &#273;&#417;n &lt; min_order.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#272;&#417;n h&agrave;ng ch&#432;a &#273;&#7841;t gi&aacute; tr&#7883; t&#7889;i thi&#7875;u.&#8221;</td><td>Kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_PTTT</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>PTTT kh&ocirc;ng trong whitelist.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho PTTT n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>Kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_EXCLUSION</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>Lo&#7841;i tr&#7915; v&#7899;i voucher &#273;ang active.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i v&#7899;i &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;ang s&#7917; d&#7909;ng.&#8221;</td><td>Disable card</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_USED</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>Voucher &#273;&atilde; d&ugrave;ng (limit/KH).</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng.&#8221;</td><td>Inline error</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_AREA</td><td>vcp2sku</td><td>Khu v&#7921;c kh&ocirc;ng h&#7907;p l&#7879;.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho khu v&#7921;c c&#7911;a qu&yacute; kh&aacute;ch.&#8221;</td><td>Disable card; toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_SKU_TYPE</td><td>vcp2sku</td><td>Lo&#7841;i SKU kh&ocirc;ng match.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m trong gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_MIN_QTY</td><td>vcp2sku</td><td>SL SP &lt; min_quantity.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;C&#7847;n th&ecirc;m X s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m &#273;&#7875; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i n&agrave;y.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; disable n&uacute;t</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_CART_CHANGED</td><td>vcp2sku</td><td>Gi&#7887; thay &#273;&#7893;i l&agrave;m voucher m&#7845;t hi&#7879;u l&#7921;c.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; b&#7883; g&#7905; do gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng thay &#273;&#7893;i.&#8221;</td><td>T&#7921; g&#7905;; toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_EXPIRED_SUBMIT</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>Expire khi submit &#273;&#417;n.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;M&atilde; &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i &#273;&atilde; h&#7871;t h&#7841;n. Vui l&ograve;ng ch&#7885;n m&atilde; kh&aacute;c.&#8221;</td><td>Ch&#7863;n t&#7841;o &#273;&#417;n</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_TIMEOUT</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>ECP API timeout &gt;10s.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;Kh&ocirc;ng th&#7875; t&#7843;i danh s&aacute;ch &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i, th&#7917; l&#7841;i.&#8221;</td><td>Banner; CTA Th&#7917; l&#7841;i</td></tr>
        <tr><td>VCP_FIRST_ORDER</td><td>C&#7843; hai</td><td>KH &#273;&atilde; c&oacute; &#273;&#417;n, voucher ch&#7881; KH m&#7899;i.</td><td class="error-inline">&#8220;&#431;u &#273;&atilde;i ch&#7881; d&agrave;nh cho kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng &#273;&#7863;t h&agrave;ng l&#7847;n &#273;&#7847;u.&#8221;</td><td>Toast; kh&ocirc;ng &aacute;p d&#7909;ng</td></tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<h1>E. Y&Ecirc;U C&#7846;U PHI CH&#7912;C N&#258;NG</h1>
<h3>1. Hi&#7879;u n&#259;ng h&#7879; th&#7889;ng (Performance)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>T&#7843;i danh s&aacute;ch voucher:</b> ECP ph&#7843;n h&#7891;i trong &lt;2 gi&acirc;y (t&#7915; khi KH b&#7845;m &#8220;Ch&#7885;n &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i&#8221; &#273;&#7871;n popup render).</li>
    <li><b>Validate voucher:</b> BE/ECP ph&#7843;n h&#7891;i trong &lt;3 gi&acirc;y k&#7875; t&#7915; khi FE g&#7917;i request.</li>
    <li><b>API timeout:</b> 10 gi&acirc;y; sau &#273;&oacute; FE hi&#7875;n th&#7883; VCP_TIMEOUT.</li>
    <li><b>T&#7843;i &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i:</b> T&#7889;i thi&#7875;u 1.000 request validate voucher/ph&uacute;t kh&ocirc;ng ngh&#7869;n.</li>
</ul>
<h3>2. B&#7843;o m&#7853;t &amp; An to&agrave;n th&ocirc;ng tin (Security)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Server-side validate b&#7855;t bu&#7897;c:</b> M&#7885;i validate t&#7841;i BE/ECP; FE ch&#7881; hi&#7875;n th&#7883; k&#7871;t qu&#7843;, kh&ocirc;ng t&iacute;nh gi&#7843;m gi&aacute; client-side.</li>
    <li><b>Rate limiting:</b> T&#7889;i &#273;a 5 l&#7847;n validate/ph&uacute;t/session &#273;&#7875; tr&aacute;nh brute-force m&atilde; voucher.</li>
    <li><b>HTTPS:</b> To&agrave;n b&#7897; API g&#7885;i ECP qua HTTPS; kh&ocirc;ng expose API key ra FE.</li>
    <li><b>Audit log:</b> Ghi nh&#7853;n: th&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m, session, voucher code, k&#7871;t qu&#7843; validate, KH ID cho fraud detection.</li>
</ul>
<h3>3. Tr&#7843;i nghi&#7879;m ng&#432;&#7901;i d&ugrave;ng &amp; Mobile responsive (UI/UX)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Responsive:</b> Popup &#432;u &#273;&atilde;i ho&#7841;t &#273;&#7897;ng t&#7889;t tr&ecirc;n Desktop &amp; Mobile (min-width 320px).</li>
    <li><b>Loading state:</b> &#272;ang validate: disable n&uacute;t + spinner; kh&ocirc;ng cho click trong khi ch&#7901;.</li>
    <li><b>Toast:</b> T&#7921; &#273;&oacute;ng sau 4 gi&acirc;y. L&#7895;i inline t&#7891;n t&#7841;i &#273;&#7871;n khi KH thay &#273;&#7893;i input.</li>
    <li><b>Scroll bar:</b> Ch&#7881; xu&#7845;t hi&#7879;n trong v&ugrave;ng danh s&aacute;ch khi &gt;452px, kh&ocirc;ng ph&#7843;i to&agrave;n popup.</li>
    <li><b>Accessibility:</b> Aria-label &#273;&#7847;y &#273;&#7911;; popup c&oacute; focus trap khi m&#7903;.</li>
</ul>

<h1>F. PH&#7908; L&#7908;C &amp; T&Agrave;I LI&#7878;U THAM KH&#7842;O</h1>
<ul>
    <li>Quy &#432;&#7899;c m&atilde;: BR theo lu&#7891;ng (NET-/SKU-BR); m&atilde; l&#7895;i ERR_NET_V01-09 / ERR_SKU_V01-09; m&atilde; chung VCP_CODE; th&ocirc;ng &#273;i&#7879;p OK: MSG_LUONG_OK.</li>
    <li>&#272;i&#7875;m &aacute;p d&#7909;ng: Internet/Combo t&#7841;i Checkout (vcp2net); SKU/Camera t&#7841;i Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng (vcp2sku).</li>
    <li>T&agrave;i li&#7879;u thi&#7871;t k&#7871; UI/UX (Figma): vcp2net.pdf, vcp2sku.pdf (docs/flowcheckout/).</li>
    <li>S&#417; &#273;&#7891; BPMN: diagrams/voucher_bpmn.svg (generator: diagrams/gen_voucher_bpmn.py).</li>
    <li>URD li&ecirc;n quan: thuyttdoc/urd_cart.doc (Gi&#7887; h&agrave;ng &amp; Checkout t&#7893;ng quan), thuyttdoc/urd_camera_cart.doc.</li>
    <li>T&agrave;i li&#7879;u &#273;&#7863;c t&#7843; API ECP (Voucher Engine) v2: [Ch&egrave;n link n&#7897;i b&#7897;].</li>
</ul>
